3.	Developing programmes to engage HRF volunteers and sustain their interest and motivation;
4.	Sourcing and managing the HRF budget;
5.	Collaborating with relevant stakeholders on reinforcement training for their assigned personnel; and
6.	Serving as a Volunteer Manager to engage and conduct training of volunteers.

